{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BqzmH46vgdExheYs1Lr1UB","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Nobel Prize in Literature 2026 winner\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Canadian poet, writer Anne Carson wins 2026 Nobel Prize in Literature\",\"url\":\"https://www.khaleejtimes.com/world/anne-carson-canadian-poet-writer-2026-nobel-prize-literature\"},{\"title\":\"Anne Carson: The 2026 Nobel Prize in Literature Winner\",\"url\":\"https://bookshop.org/lists/anne-carson-the-2026-nobel-prize-in-literature-winner\"},{\"title\":\"Nobel Prize in Literature 2026\",\"url\":\"https://nobelprize.org/prizes/literature/2026/summary\"},{\"title\":\"blue News Logo\",\"url\":\"https://www.bluewin.ch/en/lifestyle/nobel-prize-in-literature-awarded-to-canadian-anne-carson-li.3628676\"},{\"title\":\"Nobel Prize in Literature 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.nobelprize.org/prizes/literature/2026/\"},{\"title\":\"anne carson canadian poet writer 2026 nobel prize literature\",\"url\":\"https://www.khaleejtimes.com/world/anne-carson-canadian-poet-writer-2026-nobel-prize-literature?amp=1\"},{\"title\":\"the nobel prize in literature 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.bookreporter.com/features/awards/the-nobel-prize-in-literature-2026\"},{\"title\":\"1st LD Writethru: 2026 Nobel Prize in Literature goes to Canadian writer Anne Carson\",\"url\":\"https://www.thestar.com.my/news/world/2026/10/09/1st-ld-writethru-2026-nobel-prize-in-literature-goes-to-canadian-writer-anne-carson\"},{\"title\":\"nobel prize in literature 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.shankariasparliament.com/blogs/pdf/nobel-prize-in-literature-2026\"},{\"title\":\"nobel prize in literature 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.shankariasparliament.com/current-affairs/prelim-bits-6/prelim-bits-5/nobel-prize-in-literature-2026\"}]\n\nThe 2026 Nobel Prize in Literature went to Canadian poet Anne Carson. The Swedish Academy announced it on Thursday, October 8, 2026. The prize is worth 12 million Swedish crowns ($1.2 million). According to Xinhua, Carson is the second Canadian author ever to receive the honor. Her work is known for blending poetry, translation, and classical scholarship. She is widely known for her translations of classical Greek literature, and her verse novel \"Autobiography of Red\" (1998) is among her major works. The Academy's official page is at nobelprize.org.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"47781cda-253d-418f-a7d0-bd32d92faedd","uuid":"27e494fe-9107-46c4-987f-3f96788bdf97","timestamp":"2026-10-17T02:48:18.749Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Nobel Prize in Literature 2026 winner","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_011X45sQv1W2nNfYizbsSM2g","content":[{"title":"Canadian poet, writer Anne Carson wins 2026 Nobel Prize in Literature","url":"https://www.khaleejtimes.com/world/anne-carson-canadian-poet-writer-2026-nobel-prize-literature"},{"title":"Anne Carson: The 2026 Nobel Prize in Literature Winner","url":"https://bookshop.org/lists/anne-carson-the-2026-nobel-prize-in-literature-winner"},{"title":"Nobel Prize in Literature 2026","url":"https://nobelprize.org/prizes/literature/2026/summary"},{"title":"blue News Logo","url":"https://www.bluewin.ch/en/lifestyle/nobel-prize-in-literature-awarded-to-canadian-anne-carson-li.3628676"},{"title":"Nobel Prize in Literature 2026","url":"https://www.nobelprize.org/prizes/literature/2026/"},{"title":"anne carson canadian poet writer 2026 nobel prize literature","url":"https://www.khaleejtimes.com/world/anne-carson-canadian-poet-writer-2026-nobel-prize-literature?amp=1"},{"title":"the nobel prize in literature 2026","url":"https://www.bookreporter.com/features/awards/the-nobel-prize-in-literature-2026"},{"title":"1st LD Writethru: 2026 Nobel Prize in Literature goes to Canadian writer Anne Carson","url":"https://www.thestar.com.my/news/world/2026/10/09/1st-ld-writethru-2026-nobel-prize-i